commit 9fca293b2de46d3a734cd3d6e68611de6ac207a5
Author: Bart Van Assche <bvanassche@acm.org>
Date:   Fri Aug 27 10:33:46 2021 -0700

    snmpd, IP-MIB, UCD-MIB: Remove superfluous string termination code
    
    Since snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), ...) guarantees that the string written
    into `buf` is '\0' terminated if sizeof(buf) >= 1, remove the following
    statement if it occurs just past such a snprintf() statement:
    
        buf[sizeof(buf) - 1] = '\0';
    
    See also
    https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/009695399/functions/fprintf.html.

commit 277d75633d8008cde468d026694289ca32f2cb6d
Author: Bart Van Assche <bvanassche@acm.org>
Date:   Thu Aug 26 10:17:11 2021 -0700

    libsnmp: Fix undefined behavior in asn_build_int()
    
    According to the C standard, triggering an overflow by shifting a signed
    integer results in undefined behavior. Fix this by inserting a cast.
    
    Fixes: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/oss-fuzz/issues/detail?id=37579

commit d700c957f991912a63b9637720b716f6cf8696fd
