    IF-MIB: Fix deprecated retrans_time syscall warning (and base_reachable_time)
    
    Remove the check which retrans_time and base_reachable_time interface is
    available from `netsnmp_arch_interface_init`, which uses the "default"
    network interface to determine which is available, but this network
    interface is not always available (e.g. network namespaces).
    
    Determine at runtime which procfs file to read.
    
